5. API Endpoints Architecture
Theme & Catalog APIs
* GET /api/v1/themes — Fetch all active portfolio themes with pricing & thumbnail specs.
* GET /api/v1/themes/:id — Fetch single theme metadata and preview layout definitions.
Payment & Checkout APIs
* POST /api/v1/payments/create-session — Generate secure gateway session link.
* POST /api/v1/payments/webhook — Asynchronous server-to-server webhook endpoint for payment confirmation.
* GET /api/v1/payments/verify-status?transactionId=xyz — Frontend client verification query.
Editor & Portfolio State APIs
* GET /api/v1/portfolios/me — Fetch logged-in user's active portfolio state.
* POST /api/v1/portfolios/save — Save/Update user's customized portfolio layout content.
* POST /api/v1/portfolios/publish — Publish final portfolio to custom slug or domain.


